status IN ('ok', 'auth', 'payment', 'newer_protocol', 'needs_env', 'needs_args', 'needs_network')  |\n| 254 | 37 | 6 | SELECT name, url, status FROM servers WHERE host = ? ORDER BY name LIMIT ? |\n\nThe zone's analytics are not readable with the zone token (/graphql: HTTP 200 [{\"message\":\"Actor 'com.cloudflare.api.token.3e8aeda43c69fceea43404a52603bef2' does not have permissi). Add Zone: Analytics: Read to it to see what the edge stops.\n## The worst hour\n\n| | most in an hour | when (UTC) |\n|---|---:|---|\n| Worker requests | 9,934 | 03:00 |\n| D1 rows read | 73,346 | 02:00 |\n| Meta Platforms Ireland Limited (AS32934), everything | 10,130 | to 03:20 |\n| Microsoft Corporation (AS8075), everything | 68 | to 02:40 |\n| Google LLC (AS15169), everything | 40 | to 06:40 |\n| Verizon Business (AS701), agents that do not name a crawler | 11 | to 04:30 |\n| OVH (NWK) (AS16276), agents that do not name a crawler | 8 | to 05:20 |\n| Google LLC (AS15169), agents that do not name a crawler | 5 | to 02:40 |\n\n## Over the threshold\n\n- 9,934 Worker requests in the hour from 03:00 UTC, the threshold is 5,000\n\nWhich networks and agents: the tables above. A hosting network with browser agents walking the list variants is a scraper; add its ASN to SCRAPER_ASNS in site/edge/rules.mjs and the Edge rules workflow blocks it before the Worker. A verified crawler on the list variants is blocked by the zone already; one that still shows here got through, so check the rules.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ondraulehla/mcpcost/issues/comments/6381427089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":15368,"client_id":"Iv1.05c79e9ad1f6bdfa","slug":"github-actions","node_id":"MDM6QXBwMTUzNjg=","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v