_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-25T07:17:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:17:43Z","body":"Reviewed 2026-10-25.\n\n- The Meta spike that opened this issue is stopped: the zone blocks `meta-externalagent` since 2026-10-24 11:37 UTC (f39feb6). The Worker served 28 698 requests on 2026-10-24, most of them before the block, and 2 915 on 2026-10-25 to 06:14 UTC.\n- The alarm of 01:17 UTC: Hetzner (AS24940), one Chrome 122 agent, 977 server pages in about an hour, 908 in the worst hour against the threshold of 800. Not blocked: it is about 1 % of the Free plan's daily requests, and AS24940 also carries named liveness checks of `/mcp` (mcpbeat) and developer machines. The zone has no free custom rule left (5 of 5).\n- The report now has a CPU section. Over the 12 hours to 07:15 UTC, 26 % of requests took more than 10 ms of CPU, the Free plan's limit; `/mcp` is the main cost (median 12 ms, 56 % over).\n\nClosing; the next alarm opens a new issue.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ondraulehla/mcpcost/issues/comments/6394793669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]